	StatariaCommands: {
		Usage: /stataria <reset | selfreset | setlevel x | setxp x | setpoints [rp] x | setrebirth x | setstat name x | clearbosses | syncbosses | debug | diagnose | weapondebug | testxpui [amount] [total_count] [current_index] [source] | cal <fillrage | filladrenaline | infrage | infadren>>
